{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Type Pressure</strong> is a <i>Bomb Party</i> inspired word/typing game where players must type words according to the prompt that is given while trying to rack up as high of a score as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667360/extras/gameplay.gif?t=1745383376\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Customization:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Nearly all gameplay aspects can be fine-tuned to your preferences. Whether you want to disable word chaining, allow word repeats, or give yourself a little more time, each value can be easily adjusted before every game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667360/extras/customization.gif?t=1745383376\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Challenges:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Type Pressure contains 10 unique challenges to test your vocabulary and typing skills!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Power Ups:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are 6 power ups that can be activated by typing one of their corresponding words. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Heal: Restores 1 HP</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Freeze: Temporarily stops the clock</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Reset: Clears your typed words, allowing already used words to be submitted again</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wildcard: Allows your next word to be any valid word</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Charge: Doubles the score of your next word</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Extend: Increases the time per word slightly</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Statistics:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">View all your previous games, typed words, and global high scores.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667360/extras/stats-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1745383376\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3667360?t=1745383376","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3667360?t=1745383376","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667360/8c1a8c77c8c5462460c7e90c39d026deb8e3c614/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745383376","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667360/8c1a8c77c8c5462460c7e90c39d026deb8e3c614/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745383376","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Type Pressure</strong> is a <i>Bomb Party</i> inspired word/typing game where players must type words according to the prompt that is given while trying to rack up as high of a score as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667360/extras/gameplay.gif?t=1745383376\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Customization:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Nearly all gameplay aspects can be fine-tuned to your preferences. Whether you want to disable word chaining, allow word repeats, or give yourself a little more time, each value can be easily adjusted before every game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667360/extras/customization.gif?t=1745383376\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Challenges:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Type Pressure contains 10 unique challenges to test your vocabulary and typing skills!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Power Ups:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are 6 power ups that can be activated by typing one of their corresponding words. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Heal: Restores 1 HP</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Freeze: Temporarily stops the clock</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Reset: Clears your typed words, allowing already used words to be submitted again</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wildcard: Allows your next word to be any valid word</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Charge: Doubles the score of your next word</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Extend: Increases the time per word slightly</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Statistics:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">View all your previous games, typed words, and global high scores.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667360/extras/stats-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1745383376\" /></p>","developers":["at"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667360/65166ac7304a809300a38a1add433b96e0336510/header.jpg?t=1745383376","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Type Pressure","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["at"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"0","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"June 2025"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667360/723cee0e7a3169c268bff